{
  "id": "table-barometer",
  "title": "Table Barometer",
  "description": "An always-on palette where players signal how they feel about the session — fun, pace, amount of roleplay — on three-position toggles. The GM gets an anonymised summary showing the distribution, not just the average. Nothing is stored or historised.",
